      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "@{58c6b3cc227a56787575ebb4|full_name}: this is issue for windows mixed reality controllers. The controllers have two analog sticks but they aren't used in VRChat. The right analog stick can be used for rotating left and right if you do a workaround but the left stick does nothing. We would like the ability to move around using the left stick. Currently moving is done on the circle pad which also controls gestures so moving in VRChat causes random gestures to happen.\n\nThis issue is also listed under a different tag here:\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/windows-mr-controller",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
